# ENTRELUMEN: FTB XMod Compat is here so FTB Quests can use FTB Filter System's smart filters in item tasks.
# Its default stage_selector would hand FTB Library's game stages to KubeJS. "vanilla" keeps FTB Library's
# own entity-tag stages, which the companion uses to take FTB Chunks' map away inside the Envés
# (docs/design/dungeon-enves.md). Everything else keeps FTB XMod Compat's defaults.
{
	stage_selector: "vanilla"
}
